      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "Clarithromycin, 500 mg, twice a day, I think, with another antibiotic and a stomach tablet, for two weeks. I'd have to check the box.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:24",
      "end_timestamp": "00:36",
      "supports": [
        "medications[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "speaker_role": "doctor",
      "transcript_text": "So 500 mg twice a day as you recall it. And how have you been since finishing?",
      "start_timestamp": "00:38",
      "end_timestamp": "00:47",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "medications[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[0]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "speaker_role": "patient",
      "transcript_text": "The heartburn is much better, mostly, but still there in the evenings. A couple of weeks since I finished.",
      "start_timestamp": "00:50",
      "end_timestamp": "01:00",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
      "evidence_id": "EV_006",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "speaker_role": "family_member",
      "transcript_text": "It's been a month, Frank. You finished on the fourth. I wrote it on the calendar.",
      "start_timestamp": "01:02",
      "end_timestamp": "01:12",
      "supports": [
        "symptoms[0]",
        "clinical_uncertainties[1]"
      ]
    },
    {
